evitaDB - Third-party test data in evita_functional_tests
=========================================================

This module carries four Hunspell spell-checking dictionaries under
`src/test/resources/fulltext/hunspell/`. They are third-party works, copied
unmodified, and they keep their own licences - evitaDB's Business Source
License does not apply to them.

They are developer instruments: the full-text lexicon-coverage sweeps and the
branching-stemmer equivalence tests read them to enumerate a language's
inflected surface forms. No evitaDB code links against them, and this module
is neither installed nor deployed (maven.install.skip / maven.deploy.skip),
so no dictionary byte reaches a released artifact.

Provenance, exact upstream revisions and checksums:
`src/test/resources/fulltext/hunspell/README.md`.


Polish dictionary (pl_PL.dic, pl_PL.aff)
----------------------------------------

From the Polish dictionary pack of the Polish Native Lang Project
(http://pl.openoffice.org), 2008-12-06 snapshot of the OpenOffice.org
dictionaries. Dictionary maintainer: Marek Futrega. Corrections:
Marcin Milkowski. Obtained through github.com/wooorm/dictionaries
(`dictionary-pl` 2.0.0, commit 8cfea406b505e4d7df52d5a19bce525df98c54ab),
whose own MIT licence covers the packaging only.

Upstream licence statement, verbatim:

    This dictionary for spell-checking Polish texts is licensed under
    GPL, LGPL, MPL (Mozilla Public License) and Creative Commons
    ShareAlike licenses (see http://creativecommons.org/licenses/sa/1.0).

The statement names no versions; the redistributor records the SPDX
expression (GPL-3.0 OR LGPL-3.0 OR MPL-2.0). evitaDB relies on the MPL
option.


