Czech dictionary (cs_CZ.dic, cs_CZ.aff)
---------------------------------------

Czech ispell dictionary by Petr Kolar and contributors, converted to Hunspell
and updated in 2021 by Miroslav Posta (https://www.translatoblog.cz), shipped
as the LibreOffice Czech spelling extension version 2021.07. Obtained from
github.com/LibreOffice/dictionaries at commit 8cd38fb513 (2021-06-16).

Upstream licence statement, from the extension's README_en.txt:

    License: GNU/GPL

The attached licence text is the GNU General Public License, Version 2. This
is the one dictionary of the four that offers no permissive alternative.

evitaDB redistributes it unmodified and alongside - never combined with - its
own licensed work: no evitaDB code links against it, derives from it, or
embeds any part of it, and it is read only by tests. That is mere aggregation
on a storage medium in the sense of GPL-2.0 section 2, which the licence
permits. See the README named above for the full argument.
